WEBVTT

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.843
Every individual alarm is clear.

00:00:03.063 --> 00:00:04.828
But the system is not safe.

00:00:05.138 --> 00:00:06.509
Extraction is down.

00:00:06.689 --> 00:00:07.943
Hot work is planned.

00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:10.984
Four people are moving toward the gas corridor.

00:00:11.394 --> 00:00:16.893
Compound Zero connects these weak signals before any one device crosses its threshold.

00:00:17.423 --> 00:00:20.155
The replay is deterministic and simulated.

00:00:20.495 --> 00:00:23.832
Every state is served by the calibrated model API.

00:00:24.102 --> 00:00:30.683
A fixed seed makes every event, score, timestamp, and receipt reproducible from end to end.

00:00:31.153 --> 00:00:34.509
At T plus nine, fusion raises the first warning.

00:00:34.779 --> 00:00:37.813
The authored harmful state is still thirteen minutes away.

00:00:38.173 --> 00:00:45.751
By T plus eighteen, the score is one hundred, four people are exposed, and every device alarm still reads clear.

00:00:46.081 --> 00:00:51.720
That eight-minute lead is the window for controlled intervention before the simulated harmful state.

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:54.259
The evidence graph shows why.

00:00:54.569 --> 00:01:02.274
A rising gas pattern overlaps an impaired extraction barrier, an active ignition source, and worker exposure.

00:01:02.654 --> 00:01:05.265
No language model writes this risk score.

00:01:05.505 --> 00:01:10.152
The path is structured, timestamped, and traceable to source receipts.

00:01:10.452 --> 00:01:17.439
Each edge records its source, time, relationship, and confidence so an operator can challenge the result.

00:01:18.019 --> 00:01:20.826
The safety officer opens the response studio.

00:01:21.086 --> 00:01:25.966
Holding the hot-work permit projects the replay score from one hundred to seventy-one.

00:01:26.296 --> 00:01:28.184
This is a non-causal dry run.

00:01:28.484 --> 00:01:32.617
It records a human decision; it does not actuate plant equipment.

00:01:33.127 --> 00:01:43.809
The same case now enters four bounded services: privacy-preserving event metadata, numeric fusion, cited local retrieval, and deterministic permit checks.

00:01:44.159 --> 00:01:46.344
No raw camera frame is accepted.

00:01:46.544 --> 00:01:48.930
No biometric identity is needed.

00:01:49.210 --> 00:01:51.324
Missing evidence remains visible.

00:01:51.754 --> 00:01:54.796
The response plan requires three human roles.

00:01:55.116 --> 00:02:01.145
Watch the approvals advance in sequence while actuation stays none and execution stays manual.

00:02:01.405 --> 00:02:06.165
The recommendation remains advisory until the named approvers record their decisions.

00:02:06.775 --> 00:02:08.049
Now the evidence.

00:02:08.279 --> 00:02:15.352
On the base whole-seed holdout, fusion detects all sixty-five simulated events, with a twelve-minute median lead.

00:02:15.722 --> 00:02:18.034
But the harder test changes the story.

00:02:18.314 --> 00:02:21.809
Leave-one-scenario-type-out recall falls to eighty percent.

00:02:22.269 --> 00:02:25.732
The model misses the unseen process-drift family completely.

00:02:26.092 --> 00:02:32.292
That failure is why deployment remains behind local calibration and prospective shadow validation.

00:02:32.582 --> 00:02:37.402
The interface exposes that miss instead of hiding it behind aggregate accuracy.

00:02:38.042 --> 00:02:45.445
The safety case keeps the decision, model version, input receipts, operator action, and limitations together.

00:02:45.785 --> 00:02:47.577
The policy gate is explicit.

00:02:47.767 --> 00:02:50.557
Advisory notifications may be automatic.

00:02:50.807 --> 00:02:52.533
Permit holds need a person.

00:02:52.923 --> 00:02:54.952
Process isolation needs two.

00:02:55.392 --> 00:03:00.159
Legal and standards references are navigation aids, not certification.

00:03:00.489 --> 00:03:05.726
The prototype also keeps physical alarms and safety-instrumented systems independent.

00:03:06.006 --> 00:03:10.126
Every exported evidence bundle preserves those boundaries for review.

00:03:11.000 --> 00:03:12.050
What did we build?

00:03:12.260 --> 00:03:21.012
Five working operator workspaces, a calibrated risk API, honest robustness evidence, and a human-gated response path.

00:03:21.502 --> 00:03:26.026
Compound Zero does not replace the plant's safety systems or its people.

00:03:26.376 --> 00:03:30.894
It gives them the missing context, and the time, to act before the alarm.
